Candidate 5 is a build.py-only change on top of 446f2fa (repeat d288047). A new helper, _host_array, converts long host Python lists with one np.asarray(dtype=int64/complex128) and then calls jnp.asarray, replacing jnp.array(list, dtype=...). It applies to:
- the parameter row;
- the grouped function_rows, output_rows and parameter_indices;
- the per-system function_indices;
- the optimized parameter and value index lists.

Values, dtypes and topology are unchanged. The notes record the coordinator's corrections: the seed has three runs (22.37, 22.66 and 22.26 s), and no new-best claim is made under the parallel epoch.

